        <see langword="true" /> if a .wav file is loaded; <see langword="false" /> if a .wav file has not yet been loaded.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="M:System.Media.SoundPlayer.Load">
      <summary>Loads a sound synchronously.</summary>
