      <param name="culture">Specifies the culture of the assembly. A blank string indicates the invariant culture.</param>
      <param name="processorArchitecture">Specifies the processor architecture of the assembly. Valid values are <see langword="msil" />, <see langword="x86" />, <see langword="ia64" />, and <see langword="amd64" />.</param>
