      <returns>The collection of child elements of the <see cref="T:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonApplicationMenu" /> that is associated with this <see cref="T:System.Windows.Automation.Peers.RibbonApplicationMenuAutomationPeer" />.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="T:System.Windows.Automation.Peers.RibbonAutomationPeer">
