      <summary>Defines constants that specify whether the <see cref="E:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonControlService.DismissPopup" /> attached event closes all drop-downs in a chain of drop-downs or only drop-downs that the mouse pointer is not over.</summary>
