    <member name="P:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonControlService.IsInControlGroup">
      <summary>Gets a value that indicates whether the control is hosted in a <see cref="T:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonControlGroup" />.</summary>
      <returns>
          <see langword="true" /> if the control is hosted in a <see cref="T:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonControlGroup" />; otherwise, <see langword="false" />. The registered default is <see langword="false" />. For more information about what can influence the value, see Dependency Property Value Precedence.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonControlService.IsInQuickAccessToolBar">
      <summary>Gets a value that indicates whether the control is hosted in the Quick Access Toolbar.</summary>
