          <see langword="true" /> to show the keyboard focus visual; otherwise, <see langword="false" />. The registered default is <see langword="false" />. For more information about what can influence the value, see Dependency Property Value Precedence.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.Windows.Controls.Ribbon.RibbonQuickAccessToolBar.IsOverflowItem">
