    </member>
    <member name="F:System.DirectoryServices.ActiveDirectory.ActiveDirectorySiteOptions.UseWindows2000IstgElection">
      <summary>The KCC is forced to use the Windows 2000 ISTG election algorithm.</summary>
    </member>
