      <returns>The string representation of the color. The default implementation represents the <see cref="T:System.Byte" /> values in hex form, prefixes with the # character, and starts with the alpha channel. For example, the <see cref="M:System.Windows.Media.Color.ToString" /> value for <see cref="P:System.Windows.Media.Colors.AliceBlue" /> is #FFF0F8FF.</returns>
    </member>
