      <summary>Gets a value that represents the color profile associated with a bitmap, if one is defined.</summary>
      <returns>An instance of <see cref="T:System.Windows.Media.ColorContext" /> that represents the embedded color profile of the bitmap. If no color profile has been defined, this property returns <see langword="null" />. This property has no default value.</returns>
    </member>
