      <summary>Gets a <see cref="T:System.Windows.Media.Imaging.BitmapSource" /> that represents the global preview of this bitmap, if one is defined.</summary>
      <returns>A <see cref="T:System.Windows.Media.Imaging.BitmapSource" /> that represents the global preview of the bitmap. If no preview is defined, this property returns <see langword="null" />. This property has no default value.</returns>
    </member>
